  << /ActualText (\042In 50 years\054 the technology around us will feel like magic\056 But will the way we talk to each other really stay the same\077 The virtual world is already seamless\072 payments happen on their own\054 search answers before the question\047s finished\056 The physical world hasn\047t caught up\072 saying something to the person nearby still means reaching for \na phone\056 VOIZEX closes that gap\056 A device \nyou wear as if you knew another language\056 Technology made for the human\072 no screen between you\054 no interruption to a natural conversation\056\042)
